{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"A Starting Guide (Sessions)"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/IssuingSDKDocs"]]},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Provisioning Sessions","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Card Sessions","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Prerequisites","anchor":"Prerequisites","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Embed the Certificate","anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Fetch a Session Token","anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Perform a ","type":"text"},{"code":"POST","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" request to the following endpoint:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Environment"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"URL"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Test"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/test.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Live"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/authe-live.adyen.com\/authe\/api\/v1\/sessions"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Headers:"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Content-Type: application\/json","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"X-API-Key: YOUR_API_KEY","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body:"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["{","    \"product\": \"platform\",","    \"policy\": {","        \"resources\": [","            {","                \"type\": \"paymentInstrument\",","                \"paymentInstrumentId\": \"...\"","            }","        ],","        \"roles\": [\"...\"]","    }","}"],"syntax":"json","type":"codeListing"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The required "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"roles"},{"type":"text","text":" depend on the SDK feature you are using. See the feature-specific documentation for details."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your backend should receive the session token and pass it to your iOS application.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Import the SDK","anchor":"Import-the-SDK","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the appropriate import statements at the top of your Swift files:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["import CardProvisioningSessions","import IssuingCommon"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This gives you access to all public types, including ","type":"text"},{"code":"TokenProviding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"Configuration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"ProvisioningSession","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Do not import "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore"},{"type":"text","text":" directly. It is an internal dependency that is required at link time but has no public API for integrators."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside"},{"text":"Implement a Token Provider","anchor":"Implement-a-Token-Provider","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Your app needs an object that conforms to the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"text":" protocol. This object is responsible for supplying the session token fetched in the previous step.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import IssuingCommon","","class TokenProvider: TokenProviding {","    func retrieveToken(for paymentInstrumentIds: Set<String>) async throws -> String {","        \/\/ Implement the logic to retrieve the session token for the given","        \/\/ payment instrument IDs from your backend and return it.","        let sessionToken = \"...\"","        return sessionToken","    }","}","","let tokenProvider = TokenProvider()"],"type":"codeListing"},{"text":"Device Testing Requirements","anchor":"Device-Testing-Requirements","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK requires a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Release build on a physical device"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" for full end-to-end functionality. Use TestFlight to distribute Release builds to testers. The iOS Simulator is suitable for UI development and integration work, but provisioning flows cannot complete on the Simulator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Next Steps","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Next-Steps"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Once you have completed the common setup, proceed to the feature-specific guide:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/CardProvisioningGuide","isActive":true},{"text":" — Understand the two provisioning approaches and choose the right one for your architecture","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/SessionsProvisioningGuide"},{"type":"text","text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet using the session-based API (recommended)"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/OfflineProvisioningGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — Add cards to Apple Wallet with direct control over each provisioning step","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/CardSessionsGuide","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" — Reveal card details, reveal PIN, change PIN (Work in Progress)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\